{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-v5JDyVqn\">该类报错是由于传入账户ID不存在，或不符合接口要求传入账户类型导致报错。</p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-2IBbER4u\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-2IBbER4u\">确认接口所需传入账户类型</h1><p data-id=\"p0e47204-DqHq8Qmp\">请求接口时需根据接口文档描述传入指定类型账户ID，例如以下表格文档举例</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table data-id=\"thtdixl28-7kzvoe3gtnw000\" data-custom=\"true\" class=\"data-table\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-10na5ruoudds000\"><col width=\"173\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikyvbp3s-16r59nwpiebg000\"><col width=\"498\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1uwadb7k-g2spaw8pf6o000\"><col width=\"208\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikzrv9uo-3fq59rnqqkm000\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-16lnqdsjs9kw000\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-11q8nxv1mg0g000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-lyhsbjtuqtc000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-t3owbua6kvk000\">文档类别</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-bv54857bu14000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-9vq42c9rbjs000\">文档内容</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-guqm73k7tk0000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1k66ds4x51sw00\">要求类型</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1kc710ontyps000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-c2m2j7memzk000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-15lvy9wmt09s000\">巨量营销</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-cm6d0q6ywmg000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-1cvlnf9ijxk0000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/dad05cda2c2448558bf46b2d54574b2b~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2040289919&amp;x-signature=SUC0k2SZ3%2Fs3xg5hh%2FJQFQytF%2FE%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 2000px; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-fz0phszcb60000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-1ioj7fvkplz4000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1a2d45a0k7ds000\">巨量营销投放账户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-12fc0gcknfi8000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-xkrc20q9lls000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-192odf9gal6o000\">方舟（代理商）</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-3hadb3minim000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-m1z5axheke8000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/95884bbc829d42309acd5b9843234521~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2040289926&amp;x-signature=NAumyUAUaSbS3jxJS5eG0odBgUU%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 2000px; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-k3bhs61mufk000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-lwpyvr8iam8000\">方舟平台代理商账户（agent_id）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-91ne55l7xsg00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14ojdgxs-1614hte8bk3g000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kse2wxjgq80000\">工作台（旧版巨量引擎工作台）</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14ojdgxs-1c1v5qtnf5mo000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-1abeagebhqyo000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/82f3844e9aae4eb2b67c4722be9273a5~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2040289936&amp;x-signature=o3w3VmMpOn%2B5ZFtURZUMcb9Hf1Q%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 2000px; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tve1dly4w-1hjnkdhsijvk000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-154xvdtnckw0000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台账户ID</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-6NDjcRPi\"><br></p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-Mr1oE8tg\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-Mr1oE8tg\">如何查询AccessToken 下已授权账户类型</h1><p data-id=\"p0e47204-P5YdN95b\" style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">可通过接口【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710506574848\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取已授权账户</a>】查询AccessToken对应的可操作业务账户列表，应用业务场景不同对应操作账户角色也不同。</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table data-id=\"thtdixl28-agojsd3ywy8000\" data-custom=\"true\" class=\"data-table\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-91qi7eg06qc000\"><col width=\"62\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c6otumxio-mu2do09tb6o000\"><col width=\"224\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikyvergw-gdrrz5w534g000\"><col width=\"259\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1uwamnog-138zgtdpaz68000\"><col width=\"333\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c55tx4t5c-19w1y7vhwsww000\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-cs01zu9o25c000\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1isfrgjs7400000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-3nw69ayus1i000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dt2xwou82vk000\">业务场景</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-y0sqypt1z1c000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1cozulsbgrfk000\">账户类型 account_role</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-v7r1ue4wi9s000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-afr4dhd4wf4000\">账户信息</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-7k2gd1ykiy0000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1kyiulhqhs68000\">子集业务账户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-a133cy5bv48000\" style=\"height: 123px;\"><td rowspan=\"8\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-18i0krilwrls000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ku554biing0000\">巨量营销</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-f64lx4re4p4000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-n9yh3qc3egw000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-143qfflg26ak000\">CUSTOMER_ADMIN 旧版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-uweaz18zlc0000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-d4nwpjfoujk000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2c2kojm7gskk00\">对应advertiser_id返回为旧版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，旧版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710520884224\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取旧版巨量引擎工作台下资产账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-17bkpp6hgwm8000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-1jvagwqk1aps000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-15br9vbb44sg000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-xk30xkqfeo0000\">巨量投放账户（account_source = AD）</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-c1t7oijow7s000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-wh302vkbcps000\">advertiser_id 为对应客户ID，只可请求操作巨量营销相关业务接口</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-sf9vlbxmmpc000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-e7etdjjyo54000\">本地推账户（account_source = LOCAL）</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-zm2qak6d24g000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-tp6bxb82y5s000\">advertiser_id为对应本地推账户ID，只可请求操作本地推相关业务接口</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-lj6yxmi5z1s000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-1cpthd40dfi8000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-mil2r67k2ow000\">CUSTOMER_OPERATOR 旧版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t1dr9j7ls-hgkyzbs9pns000\"><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-8hmgwv2hn38000\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-nua4jm1j628000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_ENTERPRISE_BP_ADMIN</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hww9g8uvjns000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-1kka0vpd4c5c000\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1h79lnrrt2rk000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-57dw87s9w0g00\">对应advertiser_id返回为升级版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，升级版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710520884224\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1829550825614739\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取升级版巨量引擎工作台下账户列表</a>】查询</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t1dr9j7ls-9hgj48tpa8s000\"><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-16l9b4sn8axs000\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-14cq3cd4n2ww000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_ENTERPRISE_BP_OPERATOR</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-159sygc7ubhc00\">升级版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-18evdi4bfby8000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-1ht36fj4wikg000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-j5zui9n5y8g000\">AGENT 方舟代理商账户</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-1eiivvz0d8g0000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1cnb2ljc6vls000\">对应advertiser_id返回为代理商账户ID，代理商下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710516003852\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商管理账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1kduakwreae8000\">company_list不为空时，代表仅能访问该部分客户id下的adv，以company_list下customer_company_id为准</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1aa99md4tn5s000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-uqg20piynrk000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-hzq28urgm40000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-10raipc5j974000\">巨量投放账户（account_source = AD）</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-gctlm7pzvwo000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1kzyik5zm4zk000\">list内内容为对应客户ID，只可请求操作巨量营销相关业务接口</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1ad4lp4lkv6o000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1131pa1d5lsg000\">星图账户（account_source = STAR）</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-apc274juaog000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-o91y2z60lds000\">list内内容为对应星图账户ID，只可请求操作巨量星图相关业务接口</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-r375gvmpghc000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-142lejzjn334000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-1ky87s6b48lc000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-deb48zqxg00000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_STAR_AGENT 星图代理商</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-zp7xbhmfy4w000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-plxj9wksi0g000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-akownhi1bkw000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1eed7rk3blls000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_STAR 星图账户</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-fzmqvr1dqwo000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-16ivga2jr1sw000\">对应advertiser_id返回为星图账户ID，只可请求操作巨量星图相关业务接口</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-7z5oj7p4g7k000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-jgqka7r8n5k000\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-60pmiy7wnvs000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-x0tdgnwbzmo000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ykpyk8epjf4000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_AWEME 抖音号</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-maealowdx68000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-137bg8x70v28000\">对应account_string_id返回为DOU+账户ID，只可请求DOU+相关业务接口</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-1eja8lo7mbb4000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-1a1520btgjxc000\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1kktrvf7iaw0000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"7\" data-id=\"t14ojdgxs-o24qz3zmxnk000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bxbdnmbd25c000\">巨量千川</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-xu5fj7i33zk000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-7fwxdkrd3fo00\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-rrk1u3ihj0000\">ADVERTISER 投放账户</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-dvpwz6z8v6w000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-19feidvf29vk000\">对应advertiser_id返回为随心推账户ID，只可请求千川随心推相关业务接口能力</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-1l19meswjtls000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-2t4gj0km9gg000\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1icfvihjab9c000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-11onowlayjrk000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dp0bc91o5mo000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_SHOP_ACCOUNT 抖店店铺</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-zi34pwudui8000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-o2q0ub8ei5c000\">对应advertiser_id返回为千川店铺ID，店铺下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697467801357320\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取店铺关联账户列表</a>】查询</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-97r1hzhhuy8000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-16kpjwbblzds000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-my17wltycao000\">extra_permission 不包含 QC_AWEME</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-ndkenzh11ts000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-l4i6pdhbysg000\">adv_id为对应千川客户ID，仅支持操作千川PC相关业务接口能力</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1av35mfizhwg000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4pf0r6cpplo000\">extra_permission 包含 QC_AWEME </li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-c6flq3lhk3k000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4rfdo0prz8q00\">adv_id可以作为随心推业务账户，可以使用千川随心推相关业务接口能力</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1cibrvb8d0sg000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-x1horwh7t1c000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1kclh02joxhc000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_QIANCHUAN_AGENT 方舟代理商</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-119niasvc2xs000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-r5b4p7qyn8g000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-9uitdo9p4fg000\">对应advertiser_id返回为代理商账户ID，代理商下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697467832592392\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商管理账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-74bonnnoovk000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-100a1f3sqazk000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-4exfa262l4w000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-18yxwkwkezkw000\">CUSTOMER_ADMIN 旧版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t14ojdgxs-wsso539zq6o000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-73aggsci6ng000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-g57bp1yq3jc000\">对应advertiser_id返回为旧版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，旧版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1796368918556803\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取旧版巨量引擎工作台下账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1ex0atfl05vk00\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\" data-id=\"tve1dly4w-rq1yvd036y8000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-66t745n02lo000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1c58q827k57k000\">巨量千川账户（account_source = QIANCHUAN ）</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-18lwdvzqnvk0000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-z032af1v1ts000\">advertiser_id 为对应客户ID，只可请求操作巨量千川PC相关业务接口</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-9ae0gcqxb60000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-33ep2mubqw000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14ojdgxs-17hnj1vqnun4000\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1099p153w4eo000\">CUSTOMER_OPERATOR 旧版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t1dr9j7ls-7znx93z6uxg000\"><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-1iptkd8f7lnk000\" class=\"\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dfd45smv6so000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_ENTERPRISE_BP_ADMIN</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-szt4auks1f4000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-1232lysrpynk000\" class=\"table-last-column\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-d51lh3ywwnk000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1inh8fv2oqw0000\">对应advertiser_id返回为升级版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，升级版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710520884224\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1829550825614739\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取升级版巨量引擎工作台下账户列表</a>】查询</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t1dr9j7ls-101wjpqqov28000\"><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-ghlb1wzmo4g000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-nle9vdfo3m8000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_ENTERPRISE_BP_OPERATOR</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-i8ct909ngq8000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-0f0dSVyj\"><br></p></div>",
